  >>>>>>>>>]                                                   ; continued
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
  >>>>>>>>>                                                    ; continued
  +++++++                                                      ; the rotation count
<<<<
